{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Pc4jV4Lw97cr6kHWVPrEEJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VrzaaQjgBxBhMdRo6hhykX","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"struct_self_consist_ie","file":"ROADMAP.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1336,"cache_read_input_tokens":17025,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1336,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":72,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NDN5EJVznypDuAZ466asih","session_id":"47bca196-4c67-4d68-8d31-da0cb691f636","uuid":"f20b2fb8-adb0-4bf3-88a8-2fefbefcdcd2"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VrzaaQjgBxBhMdRo6hhykX","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_1/projects/struct_self_consist_ie/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# struct_self_consist_ie — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 09:34 UTC | 更新原因: MVP 完成，进入 Research 阶段。Narrative A 确定，framing + plan + dream 已触发。\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nStructural self-consistency (soft Jaccard) 作为 IE test-time scaling 的置信度信号。核心发现：entity-level (NER) 上 SJ 显著优于 surface agreement (FK)，但 relational tasks (RE) 因复合错误传播导致信号退化——建立了 consistency-based TTS 的任务复杂度边界。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前阶段\\\\n**Research 阶段** — MVP 已完成（2026-05-14），假设部分验证。走 Narrative A：NER-primary + RE diagnostic。\\\\n\\\\n### MVP 结论\\\\n- NER: rho_sj=0.388, SJ>FK +12pp (p=2e-20) → **PASS**\\\\n- RE full: rho_sj=0.234 < 0.30 → **FAIL**\\\\n- RE conditional: rho_sj=0.372, SJ>FK +11.8pp → 强信号（capability-range 内有效）\\\\n- E1 度量分解：乘性假设 REJECTED，RE weakness 是固有属性非设计问题\\\\n\\\\n## 实验计划\\\\n详见 experiment_plan.yaml。覆盖率用 `compute_coverage_matrix()` 查询。\\\\n\\\\n| 优先级 | GPU 预算 | 实验数 | 状态 |\\\\n|--------|---------|--------|------|\\\\n| P0 | 24h | 5 (exp-001~005) | 待 dream 审批 |\\\\n| P1 | 27h | 4 (exp-006~009) | 计划中 |\\\\n| P2 | 5h | 2 (exp-010~011) | 备选 |\\\\n\\\\nP0 关键实验：NER N=16 (exp-001) + CoNLL-2003 (exp-002) + OntoNotes (exp-003) + RE 诊断分析 (exp-004) + 温度敏感性分析 (exp-005)\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] MVP 验证完成 → complete_mvp()\\\\n- [x] 写 paper_framing.md (Narrative A: NER-primary + RE diagnostic)\\\\n- [x] 写 experiment_plan.yaml (P0/P1/P2 共 11 个实验)\\\\n- [x] 触发 dream_simulate (dream_20260514T093336, full review)\\\\n- [ ] 等待 Dream 完成回调 → 审阅模拟审稿 → 决定是否调整 framing/plan\\\\n- [ ] Dream 通过后批准 P0 实验（exp-001~005 可并行）\\\\n- [ ] Agent 准备 E3 N=16 代码 + E4 多数据集数据调研（进行中）\\\\n- [ ] 更新 pilot_005 registry 为 DONE\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nautodl-5090: 4× RTX 5090 32GB + gpu-5090-4x-2: 4× RTX 5090 32GB = 8 卡\\\\n当前全部空闲（等待 dream 审批后启动 P0 实验）。\\\\nP0 全量 ~24 GPU-hours，8 卡并行 < 1 天可完成。\\\\n\\\\n## 时间线\\\\n- **目标**: EMNLP 2026 via ARR May, DDL **2026-05-25**（距今 11 天）\\\\n- 备选: ARR August 2026 (2026-08-03)\\\\n- P0 实验: 1-2 天 | 论文写作: 2-3 天 | 迭代: 2-3 天 → 紧凑但可行\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D010 | 2026-05-14 | pilot_005 T=0.7 确认 RE full FAIL (rho=0.234<0.30)，但 | mvp_pilot_005, mvp_pilot_004, e1_component_wise_re_sj |\\\\n| D009 | 2026-05-14 | E1 否定乘性惩罚假说，方案 B 排除，确认走方案 A（NER-primary + RE 诊断） | e1_component_wise_re_sj, mvp_pilot_004 |\\\\n| D008 | 2026-05-14 | E1 否定乘性惩罚假设，Narrative B 排除，确认走 Narrative A (NER-pr | e1_component_wise_re_sj, mvp_pilot_004, mvp_pilot_005 |\\\\n| D007 | 2026-05-14 | Gate 1 FAIL (RE rho_sj=0.244<0.30), 但 T=1.0 zero r | mvp_pilot_004, mvp_pilot_003 |\\\\n| D006 | 2026-05-14 | Narrative 选择方案 A (stay-the-course)：等 ft_002_v2 改进  | mvp_pilot_001, ft_002 |\\\\n| D005 | 2026-05-14 | MVP pilot ft_001 结果：FAIL but positive signals. 等 f | ft_001 |\\\\n| D004 | 2026-05-14 | Gate 0: NER PASS (60.4%), RE FAIL (33.8%). 执行方案 C— | ft_001 |\\\\n| D003 | 2026-05-14 | SciERC RE 替代 ACE05 EAE 作为 MVP high-headroom subtas | — |\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-14 | 采纳 Reviewer 审查意见，收紧 MVP pass/fail 标准 | — |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-14 | MVP 方案: ACE05 上验证 structural consistency vs Fleiss | — |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2809, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01NDN5EJVznypDuAZ466asih","session_id":"47bca196-4c67-4d68-8d31-da0cb691f636","uuid":"95222c19-ebc6-4a88-ab97-af3f31038b9c","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:16:06.740Z"}
